---
import SectionHead from '@components/SectionHead.astro';

const CLIENTS = ['中国人寿', '新华人寿', '阳光人寿', '平安保险', '太平洋保险', '招商仁和人寿'];
---

<section
    class="services-insurance-clients section section--dark"
    aria-labelledby="services-insurance-clients-title"
>
    <div
        class="glow services-insurance-clients__glow"
        aria-hidden="true"
    />
    <div class="shell services-insurance-clients__inner">
        <SectionHead
            eyebrow="Insurers We Serve"
            headingId="services-insurance-clients-title"
            isCentered
            isOnDark
        >
            已服务的商保伙伴
            <Fragment slot="text">
                <p>惠泽已为众多保险公司提供就医绿通、院内护理、术后康复、全球药械与普药购药等各类服务，赢得客户的一致好评。</p>
            </Fragment>
        </SectionHead>

        <ul
            class="services-insurance-clients__list"
            data-scroll="scale"
            data-scroll-stagger
        >
            {CLIENTS.map(client => (
                <li class="services-insurance-clients__item">{client}</li>
            ))}
        </ul>

        <p
            class="services-insurance-clients__note"
            data-scroll
        >
            2024年3月，招商仁和人寿与上海惠泽健康签署全面战略合作协议，围绕大健康生态圈、保险产品创新与健康医疗大数据平台展开深度合作。
            <a href="/news/company">查看合作详情</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .services-insurance-clients {
        overflow: clip;
    }

    .services-insurance-clients__glow {
        right: -8.75rem;
        top: -10rem;
    }

    .services-insurance-clients__inner {
        position: relative;
    }

    .services-insurance-clients__item {
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--color-white-08);
        border: 0.0625rem solid var(--color-white-12);
        border-radius: var(--radius-card-sm);
        color: #FFFFFF;
        display: flex;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(1rem, calc(0.92rem + 0.42vw), 1.25rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        justify-content: center;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        min-height: 5.5rem;
        padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .services-insurance-clients__list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        list-style: none;
        margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .services-insurance-clients__note {
        color: var(--color-white-70);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.9;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        margin-inline: auto;
        max-width: var(--measure-prose);
        text-align: center;
    }

    .services-insurance-clients__note a {
        color: var(--color-reef);
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: color var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out), opacity var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out);
        white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .services-insurance-clients__note a:active {
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .services-insurance-clients__note a:hover {
        color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .services-insurance-clients__list {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }
    }

</style>
